      "title": "File:台東東河橋.jpg",
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/d9/%E5%8F%B0%E6%9D%B1%E6%9D%B1%E6%B2%B3%E6%A9%8B.jpg",
      "descriptionUrl": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E5%8F%B0%E6%9D%B1%E6%9D%B1%E6%B2%B3%E6%A9%8B.jpg",
      "width": 3024,
      "height": 4032,
